{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/3231","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/3231/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/3231/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/3231/events","html_url":"https://github.com/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/3231","id":519131302,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU1MTkxMzEzMDI=","number":3231,"title":"E1101 false positive for abstract properties","user":{"login":"stmlange","id":31351627,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMzUxNjI3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31351627?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stmlange","html_url":"https://github.com/stmlange","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stmlange/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stmlange/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stmlange/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stmlange/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stmlange/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stmlange/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stmlange/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stmlange/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stmlange/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":297274515,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyOTcyNzQ1MTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/labels/Bug%20:beetle:","name":"Bug :beetle:","color":"ea9896","default":false,"description":""},{"id":964767987,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5NjQ3Njc5ODc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/labels/inference","name":"inference","color":"fafcb3","default":false,"description":""}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2019-11-07T09:04:13Z","updated_at":"2020-03-06T09:57:39Z","closed_at":"2020-03-06T09:57:39Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"<!--\r\n  Hi there! Thank you for discovering and submitting an issue.\r\n\r\n  Before you submit this, make sure that the issue doesn't already exist\r\n  or if it is not closed.\r\n\r\n  Is your issue fixed on the preview release?: pip install pylint astroid --pre -U\r\n\r\n-->\r\nHello,\r\nthis seems to be a rather minor thing (I haven't found any similar issues and the problem is present in the preview release), but when using abstract methods along with properties pylint falsely claims a `E1101 (no-member)` \r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n1. construct an abstract-class with an abstract property\r\n```python\r\nfrom abc import ABCMeta, abstractmethod\r\n\r\n\r\nclass A(metaclass=ABCMeta):\r\n    def __init__(self):\r\n        pass\r\n\r\n    @property\r\n    @abstractmethod\r\n    def a(self):\r\n        pass\r\n\r\n    @classmethod\r\n    def some_method(cls):\r\n        return cls.a.issubset({2, 3})\r\n\r\n\r\nclass B(A):\r\n    a = {1, 2, 3}\r\n\r\n\r\nb = B()\r\nprint(\"some_method: %s\" % b.some_method())\r\n```\r\n\r\n2. run pylint (e.g. `python3 -m pylint foo.py -E`)\r\n\r\n### Current behavior\r\nPylint falsely assumes that `a` is a method and not a `property`:\r\n```\r\npython3 -m pylint foo.py -E\r\n************* Module foo\r\nfoo.py:15:15: E1101: Method 'a' has no 'issubset' member (no-member)\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Expected behavior\r\npylint does not complain ;-)\r\n\r\n### pylint --version output\r\n```\r\npylint 2.4.3\r\nastroid 2.3.3\r\nPython 3.8.0 (tags/v3.8.0:fa919fd, Oct 14 2019, 19:21:23)\r\n```\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"PCManticore","id":448166,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0ODE2Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/448166?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore","html_url":"https://github.com/PCManticore","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/3231/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/3231/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}